                >
                  <span>
                    {refundScenarios[key].label}
                  </span>

                  <strong>
                    {
                      refundScenarios[key]
                        .significance
                    }
                  </strong>
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>


            <article className={styles.refundConstant}>
              <span>CONSTANT</span>

              <strong>
                Customer Service Agent 12
              </strong>

              <small>
                Action: Issue customer refund
              </small>
            </article>


            <article className={styles.refundContext}>
              <span>CHANGING CONTEXT</span>

              <dl>
                <div>
                  <dt>Refund</dt>
                  <dd>{activeRefund.refund}</dd>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <dt>Customer status</dt>
                  <dd>
                    {activeRefund.customerStatus}
                  </dd>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <dt>Authority limit</dt>
                  <dd>{activeRefund.authority}</dd>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <dt>Repeated refunds</dt>
                  <dd>{activeRefund.repeated}</dd>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <dt>Open dispute</dt>
                  <dd>{activeRefund.dispute}</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </article>


            <article
              className={`${styles.refundResult} ${
                activeRefund.tone === "routine"
                  ? styles.refundRoutine
                  : activeRefund.tone ===
                      "consequential"
                    ? styles.refundElevated
                    : styles.refundHigh
              }`}
            >
              <span>BUSINESS SIGNIFICANCE</span>

              <strong>
                {activeRefund.significance}
              </strong>
            </article>
          </div>


          <p className={styles.darkRuntimeStatement}>
            Governance should respond to the situation, not
            only the action name.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section className={styles.meaningRiskSection}>
        <div className={styles.shell}>
          <div className={styles.editorialGrid}>
            <div>
              <p className={styles.goldEyebrow}>
                MEANING BEFORE RESPONSE
              </p>

              <h2 className={styles.darkHeadline}>
                <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                  Business Significance is
                </span>

                <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                  broader than risk.
                </span>
              </h2>
            </div>

            <div className={styles.darkCopy}>
              <p>
                Risk contributes to Business Significance,
                but it does not define the concept by itself.
              </p>

              <p>
                Financial consequence, customer impact,
                delegated authority, policy, criticality and
                accountability can also make a situation
                materially significant.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div className={styles.riskComparison}>
            <article>
              <span>HIGH RISK</span>

              <strong>
                An assessment of risk
              </strong>

              <p>
                Describes one important dimension of the
                governance context.
              </p>
            </article>


            <div className={styles.notEqual}>
              <span />
              <strong>
                Not equivalent
              </strong>
            </div>


            <article className={styles.businessMeaningCard}>
              <span>
                HIGH BUSINESS SIGNIFICANCE
              </span>

              <strong>
                A materially important enterprise situation
              </strong>

              <p>
                Indicates that the current AI activity and
                its context require an appropriate governance
                response.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>


          <p className={styles.lightStatement}>
            Risk contributes to Business Significance. It
            does not define it alone.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section className={styles.explanationSection}>
        <div className={styles.shell}>
          <div className={styles.editorialGrid}>
            <div>
              <p className={styles.blueEyebrow}>
                EXPLAINABLE CONTEXT
              </p>

              <h2 className={styles.lightHeadline}>
                <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                  Show why an activity
                </span>

                <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                  became significant.
                </span>
              </h2>
            </div>

            <div className={styles.lightCopy}>
              <p>
                A significance label without supporting
                context is not enough for governance.
              </p>

              <p>
                AIGO-OS retains the factors that contributed
                to the contextual determination so later
                governance decisions can be understood.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div className={styles.explanationVisual}>
            <article className={styles.explanationSignificance}>
              <span>BUSINESS SIGNIFICANCE</span>

              <strong>HIGH</strong>

              <small>
                Contextual determination
              </small>
            </article>


            <div className={styles.explanationReasons}>
              <article>
                <span>ACTOR</span>
                <strong>
                  Procurement Agent 07
                </strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>ACTIVITY</span>
                <strong>
                  Initiate supplier payment
                </strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>AUTHORITY</span>
                <strong>
                  GBP 50,000 limit exceeded
                </strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>TRANSACTION</span>
                <strong>GBP 87,500</strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>SUPPLIER</span>
                <strong>New</strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>VERIFICATION</span>
                <strong>Incomplete</strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>POLICY</span>
                <strong>
                  New Supplier Payment Control
                </strong>
              </article>

              <article>
                <span>CONSEQUENCE</span>
                <strong>
                  Material financial transfer
                </strong>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>


          <p className={styles.darkRuntimeStatement}>
            The significance should be understandable from
            the context that produced it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section className={styles.governanceInputSection}>
        <div className={styles.shell}>
          <div className={styles.sectionIntro}>
            <p className={styles.goldEyebrow}>
              GOVERNANCE INPUT
            </p>

            <h2 className={styles.darkGovernanceTitle}>
              <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                Business Significance establishes what
              </span>

              <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                kind of situation governance is facing.
              </span>
            </h2>

            <p>
              It does not need to be the final governance
              decision. Governance Decisioning uses this
              contextual meaning together with applicable
              authority, policy and governance conditions to
              determine the response.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div className={styles.governanceInputFlow}>
            <article>
              <span>ACTOR PASSPORT</span>
              <strong>
                Procurement Agent 07
              </strong>
            </article>

            <article>
              <span>MACHINE AUTHORITY</span>
              <strong>
                GBP 50,000 autonomous limit
              </strong>
            </article>

            <article>
              <span>ACTIVITY</span>
              <strong>
                Supplier payment GBP 87,500
              </strong>
            </article>

            <article>
              <span>ENTERPRISE CONTEXT</span>
              <strong>
                New supplier and incomplete verification
              </strong>
            </article>


            <div className={styles.businessSignificanceStage}>
              <span>
                BUSINESS SIGNIFICANCE
              </span>

              <strong>HIGH</strong>
            </div>


            <div className={styles.nextGovernanceStage}>
              <span>NEXT CAPABILITY</span>

              <strong>
                GOVERNANCE DECISIONING
              </strong>

              <div>
                <span />
                <span />
                <span />
              </div>

              <small>
                Governance result intentionally unresolved
                on this page
              </small>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div className={styles.sectionAction}>
            <Link
              href="/product/governance-decisioning"
              className={styles.darkSecondaryButton}
            >
              Explore Governance Decisioning
            </Link>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section className={styles.roleSection}>
        <div className={styles.shell}>
          <div className={styles.sectionIntro}>
            <p className={styles.blueEyebrow}>
              THE AIGO-OS GOVERNANCE MODEL
            </p>

            <h2>
              <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                Enterprise context becomes
              </span>

              <span className={styles.keepLine}>
                governance meaning here.
              </span>
            </h2>
          </div>


          <div className={styles.platformRail}>
            {governanceModel.map(
              (stage, index) => (
                <div
                  key={stage}
                  className={
                    index === 2
                      ? styles.platformStageActive
                      : index < 2
                        ? styles.platformStageComplete
                        : styles.platformStage
                  }
                >
                  <span>
                    {String(index + 1).padStart(
                      2,
                      "0",
                    )}
                  </span>

                  <strong>{stage}</strong>

                  {index < 2 && (
                    <small>
                      Established context
                    </small>
                  )}

                  {index === 2 && (
                    <small>
                      Current capability
                    </small>
                  )}
                </div>
              ),
            )}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section className={styles.finalCta}>
        <div className={styles.finalGlow} />

        <div className={styles.finalInner}>
          <p className={styles.blueEyebrow}>
            BUSINESS SIGNIFICANCE
          </p>

          <h2>
            <span className={styles.keepLine}>
              Move from knowing what happened
            </span>

            <span className={styles.keepLine}>
              to understanding what it means.
            </span>
          </h2>

          <p>
            Connect AI activity with actor identity,
            delegated authority and relevant enterprise
            context so governance can understand the
            situation before deciding what should happen
            next.
          </p>

          <div className={styles.heroActions}>
            <Link
              href="/demo"
              className={styles.primaryButton}
            >
              Request a Demo
            </Link>

            <Link
              href="/product/governance-decisioning"
              className={styles.secondaryButton}
            >
              Explore Governance Decisioning
            </Link>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  );
}
